                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='23867' id='12' name='Readmission Risk by Prior Utilization' w='98400' x='800' y='44017'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='20330' id='13' name='Readmission Risk by Length of Stay' w='98400' x='800' y='67884'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='5607' id='21' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='88214'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>Key Findings:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>• Prior healthcare utilization shows the clearest relationship with observed readmission: rates increased from </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>7.5%</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> for encounters with no prior visits to </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>25.9%</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> for encounters with 6+ prior visits.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>• Emergency and urgent admissions showed slightly higher observed readmission rates than elective admissions.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>• Age groups showed relatively similar observed readmission rates, suggesting age alone provides limited separation in this test-set analysis.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>• Length of stay showed variation in readmission rates, but not a simple steadily increasing pattern.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='5608' id='30' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='93821'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Methodology:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> Observed readmission rates are calculated from the model test set (20,289 encounters). Results describe associations in the historical dataset and should not be interpreted as causal or clinically validated findings.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
